WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.434
-Welcome back, everybody!

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:04.033
We have a really great show
tonight.

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:07.734
It's a really fun show, and --
I don't know, man.

00:00:07.734 --> 00:00:09.734
I just --
-What?

00:00:09.734 --> 00:00:10.801
-I just feel like --
I don't know.

00:00:10.801 --> 00:00:12.467
I just feel like I gotta --

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:14.567
I gotta blow off some steam.
-What?

00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:16.934
-I just feel like I've got to --

00:00:16.934 --> 00:00:18.267
it's been a rough week,
you know?

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:20.100
It's been one of those weeks.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.767
You just gotta get out there,
and blow off some steam.

00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:25.400
Helmet me.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:28.868 --> 00:00:30.801
That's it. Just gonna go out!

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:33.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:37.634
Get in this mustang.
I had a rough week.

00:00:37.634 --> 00:00:39.934
Blow some steam off here.
Let me get in the car,

00:00:39.934 --> 00:00:43.434
put my seatbelt on,
and burn some rubber!

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:45.901
Whoohoo!

00:00:45.901 --> 00:00:49.133
Yeah, with my blinker on.
Yeah!

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:52.133
Alright, yeah!
This is wild!

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:56.000
This is wild!
Wow! Yeah! Whoo!

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.033
E-brake by this abandoned
factory. Here we go.

00:00:59.033 --> 00:01:02.701
Ha ha ha ha!
Sorry to leave! See you later!

00:01:02.701 --> 00:01:05.601
Here we go!

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:07.834
Doughnut time!

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:08.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:11.734
Whoo! Look at me now, man!

00:01:11.734 --> 00:01:14.400
I'm alive! I'm alive!

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.400
[ Panting ]

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:19.334
That felt good.
That felt real good.

00:01:19.334 --> 00:01:22.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:25.267 --> 00:01:28.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:31.300
[ cheers and applause ]

00:01:35.801 --> 00:01:38.200
That Mustang was badass.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:41.567
Thank you to Ford. Go check out
the 2024 Ford Mustang

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:43.033
at Ford.com.

00:01:43.033 --> 00:01:45.567
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight Show," everybody.

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:47.334
♪♪

00:01:47.334 --> 00:01:50.067
-♪ Yeah, what comes around
goes around ♪

00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:51.400
♪ Like the vortex ♪

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.834
♪ Competition, I'm all for it,
quartet ♪

00:01:53.834 --> 00:01:55.467
♪ Choke 'em out... ♪

